---
import { linkInstagramMentions } from "../../utils/instagramMentions"
import ArtworkMeta from "../../components/art/ArtworkMeta.astro"

const metaWith = linkInstagramMentions("@niwit_lertsawaengkit")
const metaPartOf = linkInstagramMentions("QR :link at @bangkok_kunsthalle")

const lineup = [
  { role: "av performance", name: "pympit" },
  { role: "av performance", name: "medina bazargali" },
  { role: "av performance", name: "dandarplaya x big dan (hepna)" },
  { role: "av lecture performance, hybrid set", name: "Giang_ws x Niwit Lertsawaengkit" },
  { role: "live coding performance", name: "Varut_0 (kolab.bkk)" },
  { role: "live coding performance", name: "3rd.order (kolab.bkk)" },
]

const ratSectionCredits = linkInstagramMentions(
  "@bangkok_kunsthalle presents Rat Section for a one-night performance joined by Wasawat Somno + Niwit Lertsawaengkit and Medulla Spinalis"
)
const ratSectionBy = linkInstagramMentions("@rat.section")
const ratSectionPresenters = linkInstagramMentions("@giang_ws + @niwit_lertsawaengkit")
const ratSectionMedulla = linkInstagramMentions("@medullaspinalisart")
const ratSectionWasawat = linkInstagramMentions("@giang_ws, 1994, Thailand")
const ratSectionNiwit = linkInstagramMentions("@niwit_lertsawaengkit")
const ratSectionMedullaHandle = linkInstagramMentions("@medullaspinalisart")
const ratSectionSupporter = linkInstagramMentions("@fuzionbkk")
const ratSectionCurator = linkInstagramMentions("@mcheara")
---

<div class="mt-4 max-w-3xl">
  <ArtworkMeta fields={[
    { label: "Date", value: "14 March 2026, 19:00" },
    { label: "With", value: metaWith, html: true },
    { label: "Format", value: "Live haircut, lecture-performance, hybrid set" },
    { label: "Presented as part of", value: metaPartOf, html: true },
  ]} />

  <p class="mb-6 art-lead" style="font-family: '403Mesapholic', monospace; font-size: calc(20px * var(--ui-scale, 1));">
    In collaboration with Niwit Lertsawaengkit, with Live Haircut
  </p>

  <p class="mb-4">
    In an age where AI concentrates power, distorts memory, deepens surveillance, and now guides
    weapons, is it not time to enter the salon and purify the spirits?
  </p>

  <p class="mb-4">
    Two performers enter the latent salon: a space inside AI where spirits made of fragments of
    human culture whisper to each other. Where once humans gathered to exchange ideas, now it is
    the (artificial?) spirits who attempt the conversation.
  </p>

  <p class="mb-4">
    A live haircut becomes the séance opening — gestures turn to sound, sounds enter the machine,
    while a lecture narrates alongside the ritual. Lecture and ritual arrive as one breath, until
    words dissolve entirely into immersive sound and image, and the purification begins.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-6 pt-4" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
    <p class="mb-2" style="font-size: calc(9px * var(--ui-scale, 1)); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.14em; opacity: 0.6;">As part of</p>
    <h2 class="font-light text-xl mb-3">QR :link</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      An audiovisual performance program and an augmented reality exhibition exploring connection
      through code, sound, image and language. Moving between scanning and sensing, building
      algorithms and respecting embedded codes, processing and navigating, the event brings
      together artists from Southeast Asia ↔ Central Asia to trace the invisible links between
      bodies, cultures and networks.
    </p>

    <p class="text-sm opacity-80 mb-2">Line-up</p>
    <ul class="text-sm space-y-1 mb-4">
      {lineup.map((item) => (
        <li>
          <span style="color: var(--text-dim);">({item.role})</span>{" "}
          <span style="color: var(--text-muted);">{item.name}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <div class="text-sm space-y-1">
      <p>Date • time: 14.03 • 19:00</p>
      <p>Location: Bangkok Kunsthalle</p>
      <p>Tickets: 300 THB Ticketmelon • 350 THB at door</p>
      <p>
        <a
          href="https://www.ticketmelon.com/bangkok-kunsthalle/qrlink"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="hover:underline"
        >
          ticketmelon.com/bangkok-kunsthalle/qrlink
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-6 pt-4" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
    <p class="mb-2" style="font-size: calc(9px * var(--ui-scale, 1)); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.14em; opacity: 0.6;">As part of</p>
    <h2 class="font-light text-xl mb-3">Rat Section</h2>

    <p class="mb-2 text-sm" set:html={ratSectionCredits} />
    <p class="mb-4 text-sm" style="color: var(--text-dim);">
      Friday, 14 August 2026 &middot; 7:30 PM – 10:00 PM
    </p>

    <div class="text-sm space-y-1 mb-4">
      <p set:html={ratSectionBy} />
      <p set:html={ratSectionPresenters} />
      <p set:html={ratSectionMedulla} />
    </div>

    <p class="mb-4">
      Rat Section is a music and performance project currently based in London that treats
      choreography, set design, and the specific qualities of each space as integral parts of
      every show. Their work moves between experimental electronic, pop, spoken word and club
      music, constructing a mythology that deliberately blurs the line between biography and
      fiction.
    </p>

    <p class="text-sm opacity-80 mb-2">Wasawat + Niwit Present</p>
    <p class="mb-4 font-light">OperationSéance: Purifying the AI Spirits in Latent Space Salon</p>

    <p class="mb-4">
      <span set:html={ratSectionWasawat} /> is an artist working with code, audiovisual/sound
      performance, and installation. His practice is organized around the act of mapping —
      holding two planes of context in tension and tracing what passes between them. A
      computational system and the ethical questions it quietly carries. A simulation and the
      physical world it stands in for. An interface and the body that encounters it.
    </p>

    <p class="mb-4">
      <span set:html={ratSectionNiwit} /> is a Bangkok-based performance artist specializing in
      live action and hair performance art. Collaborated with Mexican artist Ruth Vigueras Bravo
      at the International Performance Festival (2018 – "Artists Army", 2019 – "Eco Art") under
      the Rebel Live Action series. Presented HOS (Hair On Stage) in Manila in 2019.
    </p>

    <p class="mb-1"><span set:html={ratSectionMedullaHandle} /></p>
    <p class="mb-4 italic" style="color: var(--text-dim);">
      There are places within us that language never quite reaches.<br />
      Sometimes they appear as dreams.<br />
      Sometimes as memories that never happened.<br />
      Sometimes as a feeling that quietly refuses to leave.<br />
      What does your mind sound like when nobody else is listening?
    </p>

    <div class="text-sm space-y-1">
      <p>Date • time: 14.08.2026 • 19:30–22:00</p>
      <p>Location: Bangkok Kunsthalle</p>
      <p>Tickets: 400 THB online • 450 THB at door</p>
      <p>Supporter: <span set:html={ratSectionSupporter} /></p>
      <p>Curator / Promoter: <span set:html={ratSectionCurator} /></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
